@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5098

### Trying /me without token

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Register

POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pseudo" : "karl",
    "email": "karl@test.com",
    "password": "motdepasse"
}

### Login 

POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "karl@test.com",
    "password": "motdepasse"
}


### Trying /me with token

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me 
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 